{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "ccc225a2-d682-4627-9f77-5d44f27c99a1",
		"name": "LMS Mentoring API",
		"description": "Postman collection for Learning Management System (Mentoring Project)\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Local Development\n- Use Basic Auth with credentials: user/password or manager/secret\n\n### Cloud (SAP BTP)\n- Use OAuth2 Bearer Token from XSUAA\n- First run 'Get XSUAA Token' request to obtain access token\n- All API requests will automatically use the token\n\n## Pagination\n\nGET all endpoints support pagination via query parameters:\n- `page`: Page number (0-indexed, default: 0)\n- `size`: Page size (default: 20)\n- `sort`: Sort field and direction (e.g., `title,asc` or `createdAt,desc`)\n\nExample: `GET /api/v1/students?page=0&size=10&sort=lastName,asc`\n\n## Localization\n\nStudents have a `locale` field for email notification language preference:\n- Supported: `en`, `de`, `ru`\n- Default: `en`",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "6593295",
		"_collection_link": "https://interstellar-star-3717.postman.co/workspace/LMS-Mentoring~12b651dc-1296-4e99-b81d-a41d8e64b088/collection/6593295-ccc225a2-d682-4627-9f77-5d44f27c99a1?action=share&source=collection_link&creator=6593295"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Authentication (Cloud)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get XSUAA Token",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"xsuaa_access_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
									"    console.log(\"Access token saved to xsuaa_access_token\");",
									"    console.log(\"Token expires in: \" + jsonData.expires_in + \" seconds\");",
									"} else {",
									"    console.error(\"No access_token in response\");",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "basic",
							"basic": [
								{
									"key": "username",
									"value": "{{xsuaa_clientid}}",
									"type": "string"
								},
								{
									"key": "password",
									"value": "{{xsuaa_clientsecret}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "urlencoded",
							"urlencoded": [
								{
									"key": "grant_type",
									"value": "client_credentials",
									"type": "text"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{xsuaa_url}}/oauth/token",
							"host": [
								"{{xsuaa_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"oauth",
								"token"
							]
						},
						"description": "Gets an OAuth2 access token from XSUAA for API authentication.\n\n**The token is automatically saved to `xsuaa_access_token` environment variable.**\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Get XSUAA credentials from your app:\n   ```\n   cf env learning-management-system | grep -A 50 'lms-xsuaa'\n   ```\n\n2. Set these environment variables:\n   - `xsuaa_clientid`: clientid from credentials\n   - `xsuaa_clientsecret`: clientsecret from credentials\n   - `xsuaa_url`: url from credentials (e.g., https://xxx.authentication.us10.hana.ondemand.com)\n\n3. Run this request to get a token\n\n4. All other API requests will use the token automatically"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Verify Token (Decode JWT)",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "https://jwt.io/#debugger-io?token={{xsuaa_access_token}}",
							"protocol": "https",
							"host": [
								"jwt",
								"io"
							],
							"hash": "debugger-io?token={{xsuaa_access_token}}"
						},
						"description": "Open jwt.io to decode and verify your XSUAA token.\n\nNote: This just opens the URL - you can paste your token at jwt.io to see its contents."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "XSUAA OAuth2 authentication for SAP BTP Cloud Foundry.\n\n## How to use:\n\n1. Set environment variables from XSUAA service binding:\n   - xsuaa_clientid\n   - xsuaa_clientsecret\n   - xsuaa_url\n\n2. Run 'Get XSUAA Token' request\n\n3. The token is automatically saved and used by all API requests"
		},
